/// Puts the request in `accepted` state ÃƒÆ’Ã†â€™Ãƒâ€ Ã¢â‚¬â„¢ÃƒÆ’Ã¢â‚¬Å¡Ãƒâ€šÃ‚Â¢ÃƒÆ’Ã†â€™Ãƒâ€šÃ‚Â¢ÃƒÆ’Ã‚Â¢ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â‚¬Å¡Ã‚Â¬Ãƒâ€¦Ã‚Â¡ÃƒÆ’Ã¢â‚¬Å¡Ãƒâ€šÃ‚Â¬ÃƒÆ’Ã†â€™Ãƒâ€šÃ‚Â¢ÃƒÆ’Ã‚Â¢ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã…Â¡Ãƒâ€šÃ‚Â¬ÃƒÆ’Ã¢â‚¬Å¡Ãƒâ€šÃ‚Â the only state in which
/// [RequestStore.isChatAllowed] opens the room (and [ChatStore.activate] runs
/// through the real store path).
Future<void> _openChat(String requestId) async {
  RequestStore.requests.value = [_request(id: requestId)];
  expect(
    await RequestStore.updateStatus(requestId, RequestStatus.accepted),
    isTrue,
  );
  expect(ChatStore.isActive(requestId), isTrue);
}

